  "description": "Willow Crown Split Monogram – Elegant Botanical Serif Font with Split Letters and Willow Branch Accents\nWillow Crown Split Monogram is a refined serif font featuring regal split-letter designs crowned with flowing willow branch illustrations. This graceful typeface offers the perfect blend of structure and natural beauty—ideal for personalized name signs, wedding materials, and rustic-luxury branding. The horizontal split allows easy customization for initials, names, or titles, all wrapped in botanical elegance.\nFeatures:\nSplit-Letter Design: Elegant letterforms with a center split for easy personalization.\nWillow Foliage Accents: Flowing crown-like willow branches add natural sophistication.\nClassic Serif Style: Strong, balanced serifs bring a timeless and upscale look.\nIdeal For: Wedding signage, name monograms, Cricut crafts, custom gifts, rustic branding, luxury packaging, and home décor.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Willow Crown Split Monogram – Elegant Botanical Serif Font with Split Letters and Willow Branch Accents</p>\n<p>Willow Crown Split Monogram is a refined serif font featuring regal split-letter designs crowned with flowing willow branch illustrations. This graceful typeface offers the perfect blend of structure and natural beauty—ideal for personalized name signs, wedding materials, and rustic-luxury branding. The horizontal split allows easy customization for initials, names, or titles, all wrapped in botanical elegance.</p>\n<p>Features:</p>\n<p>Split-Letter Design: Elegant letterforms with a center split for easy personalization.<br>\nWillow Foliage Accents: Flowing crown-like willow branches add natural sophistication.<br>\nClassic Serif Style: Strong, balanced serifs bring a timeless and upscale look.<br>\nIdeal For: Wedding signage, name monograms, Cricut crafts, custom gifts, rustic branding, luxury packaging, and home décor.</p>",
